  hook=dict(text="Hoot is the park keeper today! At the playground gate there are three picture signs: a bike helmet, an ice cream with a big red cross, and a sweet wrapper going into a bin. Puffbun and Sumi ask: “What do the signs mean?” Let's sort the playground rules!"),
